{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09281","headline":"出还 · 韦应物","name":"出还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔出喜还家，今还独伤意。\n入室掩无光，衔哀写虚位。\n凄凄动幽幔，寂寂惊寒吹。\n幼女复何知，时来庭下戏。\n咨嗟日复老，错莫身如寄。\n家人劝我飡，对案空垂泪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}